<title>USA: NGC Corp names Clarke senior vp and CFO.</title>
<headline>NGC Corp names Clarke senior vp and CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>NGC Corp said Wednesday it named John Clarke as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Clarke was most recently managing director and co-head of an energy group with investment banking firm Simmons &amp; Co International.</p>
</text>
